{"id":"n87757-1-10","stage":4,"title":"휘발유 · 汽油","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87757-1-10-1","ko":"차의 기름이 다 떨어진 것 같아.","zh":"车里的油好像用完了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"차의","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기름이","meaning":"油","explanation":"기름：油；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기름","audio":"/audio/14b26cab577adc333256.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40022","senseId":"2","lemma":"기름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어진","meaning":"不足，短缺，耗尽","explanation":"떨어지다：不足，短缺，耗尽；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"19","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"14b26cab577adc33","term":"기름","zh":"油","audio":"/audio/14b26cab577adc333256.mp3","entryId":"40022","definition":"从地下开采，主要用于汽车或工厂燃料的黑色液体。","pronunciation":["기름"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"不足，短缺，耗尽","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"没进行补充，所以现在没有剩余。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b178f914ee0f5a3f876.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87757-1-10-2","ko":"그럼 중간에 주유소에 들러서 휘발유를 넣자.","zh":"那我们中途去加油站加点汽油吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중간에","meaning":"中途，中期","explanation":"중간：中途，中期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중간","audio":"/audio/541d1ddb952f8fbf865a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82141","senseId":"4","lemma":"중간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주유소에","meaning":"加油站","explanation":"주유소：加油站；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주유소","audio":"/audio/dd9e5842a0fb47ea92a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76992","senseId":"1","lemma":"주유소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들러서","meaning":"顺便去一下","explanation":"들르다：顺便去一下；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"들르다","audio":"/audio/3f6dc717f37be815b110.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67876","senseId":"1","lemma":"들르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"휘발유를","meaning":"汽油","explanation":"휘발유：汽油；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"휘발유","audio":"/audio/a10513b3e1e128f8bc66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87757","senseId":"1","lemma":"휘발유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣자.","meaning":"放入，加入","explanation":"넣다：放入，加入；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"2","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"541d1ddb952f8fbf","term":"중간","zh":"中途，中期","audio":"/audio/541d1ddb952f8fbf865a.mp3","entryId":"82141","definition":"在某事持续的时候。","pronunciation":["중간"]},{"id":"dd9e5842a0fb47ea","term":"주유소","zh":"加油站","audio":"/audio/dd9e5842a0fb47ea92a5.mp3","entryId":"76992","definition":"往汽车等里添加燃料油的地方。","pronunciation":["주ː유소"]},{"id":"3f6dc717f37be815","term":"들르다","zh":"顺便去一下","audio":"/audio/3f6dc717f37be815b110.mp3","entryId":"67876","definition":"路过时进去逗留一会儿。","pronunciation":["들르다"]},{"id":"a10513b3e1e128f8","term":"휘발유","zh":"汽油","audio":"/audio/a10513b3e1e128f8bc66.mp3","entryId":"87757","definition":"汽车或飞机等的燃料，从石油中提取而得。","pronunciation":["휘발류"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a35a60d6640f8cba9e49.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.665,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87757","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":131,"sequenceScore":2.4917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["车里的油好像用完了。","那我们中途去加油站加点汽油吧。","面包只有一个，怎么办呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["车里的油好像用完了。","那我们中途去加油站加点汽油吧。","面包只有一个，怎么办呢？"],"answer":1}]}
